<p><a id=3D"chapter-04-section-1"></a></p>
<h3>The well-ordering principle</h3>
<p>Every nonempty subset of <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-math=
ml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi=
