org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=E2=8B=85</mo><mn>1</m=
n></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex">E\cdot1</annotation></s=
emantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"true"><spa=
