<p><a id=3D"chapter-07-section-6"></a></p>
<h3>More functions than programs</h3>
<p>Functions <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmlns=
=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=3D=
"double-struck">N</mi><mo>=E2=86=92</mo><mo stretchy=3D"false">{</mo><mn>0<=
/mn><mo separator=3D"true">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=3D"false">}</mo></m=
row><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex">\mathbb N\to\{0,1\}</annotat=
ion></semantics></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"tru=
e"><span class=3D"base"><span class=3D"strut" style=3D"height:0.6889em;"></=
span><span class=3D"mord mathbb">N</span><span class=3D"mspace" style=3D"ma=
rgin-right:0.2778em;"></span><span class=3D"mrel">=E2=86=92</span><span cla=
