normal">n</span></span></span></span>-element set correspond to binary stri=
ngs of length <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><math xmln=
s=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow>=
