<p><a id=3D"chapter-13-section-9"></a></p>
<h3>Encoding a hidden card</h3>
<p>Five selected cards include two of the same suit by pigeonhole. Arrange =
ranks cyclically. Of the two directions between distinct ranks, one has dis=
tance one through six. Reveal the starting card first and hide the card tha=
t lies that many forward steps away. Their common suit communicates the hid=
den suit.</p>
<p>The other three revealed cards have <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D=
