ass=3D"mord">6</span></span></span></span> orderings. Fix a public total or=
der of cards and use those six permutations to encode the distance. For exa=
mple, if the first revealed card is the seven of a suit and the last three =
cards encode distance four, the hidden card is the jack of that suit. The m=
ethod combines a guaranteed same-suit pair, a modular rank distance, and a =
six-message channel.</p>
