mspace" style=3D"margin-right:0.1667em;"></span><span class=3D"mord mathnor=
mal" style=3D"margin-right:0.03588em;">v</span></span></span></span> and a =
row-stochastic matrix <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"katex-mathml"><m=
ath xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi=
></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"application/x-tex">L</annotation></semantic=
s></math></span><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=
