ss=3D"mord mathnormal">L</span></span></span></span>. The difference after =
a common uniform-teleport update is <span class=3D"katex"><span class=3D"ka=
tex-mathml"><math xmlns=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><=
mrow><mi>=CE=B1</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=E2=88=92</m=
o><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=3D"false">)</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encod=
ing=3D"application/x-tex">\alpha(u-v)L</annotation></semantics></math></spa=
n><span class=3D"katex-html" aria-hidden=3D"true"><span class=3D"base"><spa=
n class=3D"strut" style=3D"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;"></span><span=
 class=3D"mord mathnormal" style=3D"margin-right:0.0037em;">=CE=B1</span><s=
pan class=3D"mopen">(</span><span class=3D"mord mathnormal">u</span><span c=
